# Build output -- everything is out-of-tree under build/, so one rule covers it.
build/

# Serial captures and any other logs produced by the QEMU harness.
*.log

# Throwaway pipeline-validation files. Per the project brief these may exist
# locally for a moment but must NEVER be merged; ignoring the directory makes
# accidentally committing one impossible rather than merely discouraged.
scratch/

# Editor / IDE state. Kept out of the repo so two developers with different
# tools do not fight over each other's settings.
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp
*~

# Generated by clangd / IDE integrations from the build, not authored by us.
# scripts/compdb.sh writes both: the database the IDE reads, and the untouched
# bear transcript beside it. The extracted toolchain headers the database
# points at live in ~/.cache, outside the repo, so they need no rule here.
compile_commands.json
compile_commands.raw.json
CLAUDE.md
